WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.659 --> 00:00:06.189
The German defense minister on the military
airfield in the capital of Ni-A-mey in Niger.

00:00:06.189 --> 00:00:10.490
Germany financed the modernization of the
base and German forces stationed here support

00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:13.340
missions in neighboring Mali, and the army
of Niger.

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:22.019
Your country is a valuable, reliable and committed
partner in the fight against terrorism, against

00:00:22.019 --> 00:00:27.990
organized crime and illegal migration in the
region.

00:00:27.990 --> 00:00:33.360
We will only be able to overcome these challenges
if we work together."

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:39.290
Niger is one of the poorest countries in the
world.

00:00:39.290 --> 00:00:44.350
It's the country of origin and a transit country
for West Africans heading for Europe.

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:49.309
The army of Niger has been unable to contain
large-scale people smuggling which has been

00:00:49.309 --> 00:00:57.210
on the rise in recent years.

00:00:57.210 --> 00:01:05.060
Our troops are frustrated by the lack of transport,
the inability to react quicky and bring soldiers

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:11.750
to the places they are needed in this huge
expanse of the Sahel, where all our borders

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:14.540
are under threat.“+++

00:01:14.540 --> 00:01:20.110
For that reason Germany has provided the army
of Niger with 53 off-road trucks and has also

00:01:20.110 --> 00:01:23.030
financed a college for non-commissioned officers.

00:01:23.030 --> 00:01:26.000
The total cost: 11 million euros.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:31.270
The defense minister also officially opened
a newly built camp for seventy German soldiers

00:01:31.270 --> 00:01:32.270
in Niamey.

00:01:32.270 --> 00:01:37.140
The Bundeswehr is here for the long haul.

00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:42.500
More and more this airbase in Niamey is becoming
a hub fort he German Armed Forces.

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:49.160
Already Germany is supporting Niger and Mali
directly and a few other West African countries

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:51.390
indirectly in their fight against terrorism.

